      "examType": "BUET Admission",
      "question": "(cos 30° + i sin 30°)⁶ এর মান কত?",
      "answer": "(\\cos 30° + i\\sin 30°)^6 = \\cos(6 \\times 30°) + i\\sin(6 \\times 30°) = \\cos 180° + i\\sin 180° = -1 + 0i = -1"
